ont: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;">Lather, rinse, and enjoy this special moment together.</li></ul><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1.3em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(88, 89, 91);">&nbsp;<br>Made in Italy</p>',
